                                                "sense_id": "7aba1e7b-5824-3d9f-90a3-ca71e4b9b96f",
                                                "text": "These “islands” would provide refuge for corms and other seabirds from sea level rise as habitat is destroyed, as well as protection from land-based predators—people, dogs, cats, rats, and cars."
